on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 10 ............................. <#stop>
  [  2] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [  6] extcall 11 .............................. sound stop 2
  [  8] pushint8 22 ............................. <22>
  [ 10] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 11] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 13] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 22 to 0
  [ 15] pushint8 23 ............................. <23>
  [ 17] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 18] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 20] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 23 to 0
  [ 22] pushint8 24 ............................. <24>
  [ 24] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 25] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 27] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 24 to 0
  [ 29] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 31] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 33] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 35] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [ 37] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 39] pushint8 150 ............................ <150>
  [ 42] lt ...................................... <volym < 150>
  [ 43] jmpifz [ 73] ............................ repeat while volym < 150
  [ 46] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 48] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 50] add ..................................... <volym + 10>
  [ 51] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = volym + 10
  [ 53] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 55] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 57] pusharglist 1 ........................... <volym>
  [ 59] extcall 14 .............................. <integer(volym)>
  [ 61] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 63] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to integer(volym)
  [ 65] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 67] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <6>
  [ 69] extcall 19 .............................. Wait(6)
  [ 71] endrepeat [ 37]
  [ 73] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [ 75] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <9>
  [ 77] extcall 8 ............................... puppetTransition(9)
  [ 79] pushcons 0 .............................. <"rim.aif">
  [ 81] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"rim.aif">
